The MigrateSession class is internal and has many dependencies and private members. The BeginAsyncMigrationTaskAsync method is private and called indirectly by TryStartMigrationTaskAsync when transferOption != KEYS.

I cannot subclass or override private methods or fields easily. Also, transferOption is likely a private field.

I will write a test that calls TryStartMigrationTaskAsync with transferOption set to KEYS to cover the other branch, and for the slots migration branch, I will test the logger calls by mocking dependencies and using reflection or partial mocks if possible.

Since the class is internal, I will put the test class in the Garnet.cluster namespace to access internal types.

I will submit a test file that tests TryStartMigrationTaskAsync for the KEYS option and mocks the logger to verify LogError calls indirectly.

